seg-95731dbf3333 = <b>The rate-1/2 LDPC coding of subframes { "2" } to { "4" }.</b> Its check matrices are in Annex { "1" }, a separate file that is not in the PDF and is not vendored. Subframes { "2" } to { "4" } are carried and checked as opaque symbol blocks of the specified length, and the CRC-24Q words inside them are not verified. A stream that passes <c1/> is not shown to hold valid codewords.

