seg-bff5304c6187 = <b>Code assignment per LunaNet node</b> (Table F-1 is TBD). PRNs { "1" } to { "12" } have interim test assignments (Table { "11" }). <c1/> uses PRN <em>n</em>'s primary code with secondary S((n-1) mod { "4" }); beyond PRN { "12" } that is this implementation's pattern, not the document's. <c2/> and <c3/> take any combination, with the tertiary code of any PRN.

